    "quote": "Reports of death, injury, fire, or evacuation are due within 24 hours of discovery; all other thermal incidents are due within five calendar days. The manufacturer must notify affected customers within 24 hours for incidents involving death, injury, fire, or evacuation, and within five calendar days for other reportable thermal incidents."
