    "quote": "The maximum allowed failure rate is 5% for each model. Results and protocols must be provided to the relevant regulator and to customers who buy or own that model; they must not be published publicly at the individual-company, per-model level. A model exceeding the maximum must be reported to the regulator with a corrective-action plan and timeline."
